{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Strengthen legal protections against disposal of frozen eggs for unpaid fees",
        "additional_details": "Currently, unpaid fees can lead to disposal, in my view much like for an ordinary storage locker, despite the irreversible loss and lasting emotional impact on a person's future. I want it to be mandated that any missed payments be handled through payment plans and, beyond a set threshold, debt recovery. A debt can be recovered. Destroyed eggs cannot be replaced.",
        "background": "Strengthen legal protections so no frozen eggs can be destroyed over unpaid storage fees. Clinics must verify any debt, make real attempts to contact patients, offer payment plans and beyond a set threshold use normal debt recovery. Disposal should need explicit consent or independent authorisation.",
